## Mandate Compliance Gotchas

| Mandate | Trap | Fix |
|---------|------|-----|
| **M1 AnyIO** | `asyncio.create_task()` in `omega_hub/server.py:371` | Use `anyio.create_task_group()` |
| **M7 Local-First** | Provider fabric priority not enforced | `config/providers.yaml` local-first chain |
| **M8 Zero Telemetry** | Prometheus metrics exported | Local-only via textfile collector |
| **M9 Error Integrity** | Bare `except:` in 10+ files | Typed `except OmegaError:` + `trace_id` |
| **M10 Fleet Integrity** | 26 agents → 14 cap | Consolidation complete; no new agents |
| **M11 Soul Integrity** | `proposed_lessons.yaml` not written every session | Session end hook + agent compliance |
| **M13 Temple-Grade** | `make temple-grade` fails (m23 gate) | Fix Blocker B first |
| **M14 Heritage** | Unvetted `[id-soft:]` tags | `make heritage-map` + vet log |
| **M22 Provenance** | `provider_name` from config not response | Capture at `GenerateResult.provider_name` |
| **M23 Failure Integrity** | Soft-failures simulated | `[TOOL-CHAIN-COLLAPSE]` on mandatory tool failure |
| **M24 Venv Sovereignty** | `--break-system-packages` used | Always `.venv/bin/pip` |
| **M25 Streaming Resilience** | Chunk timeout = hard fail | 30s chunk timeout + heartbeat |
| **M26 Doc Standards** | LLM-unfriendly docs | `make doc-llm-validate` |
| **M27 Tracking Integrity** | Ad-hoc tracking files | 5-Tier architecture + `validate_tracking_state.py` |

