## Hardware-Specific Gotchas (Ryzen 5700U, 16GB RAM)

| Gotcha | Fix |
|--------|-----|
| **XMP/EXPO disabled** = 30-50% slower inference | Enable in BIOS |
| **zRAM + zswap both active** = OOM | `M27: Never run zswap and zRAM simultaneously` |
| **No `--no-mmap --mlock`** = swap thrashing | Always use for local inference |
| **Default thread count** = suboptimal | Planner=7 threads, Executor=4 threads |
| **KV cache not sized** = OOM on large context | Planner q8_0, Executor f16 |

---

## Post-Debut Gotchas (Horizon 2/3)

| Gotcha | Mitigation |
|--------|------------|
| Qdrant migration data loss | `scripts/migrate_sqlite_vec_to_qdrant.py` + recall benchmark |
| EvolveR principle quality | Utility scoring threshold (0.6) + curator review |
| Domain module bloat | Rotation class + curator governance |
| Curator bottleneck | SHARED_READ default; SHARED_WRITE only where needed |
| A2A protocol fragmentation | Single protocol in `src/omega/a2a/` |
| Agent capability registry missing | `config/agent_capabilities.yaml` + Hivemind sync |

